.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Raw inbound: session transcripts, adopters' notes, bug reports. The findings
# derived from these are committed in knowledge-catalog/reference/E0001; the
# raw material is not. It accumulates, it is unreviewed, and once a finding is
# written the transcript is spent. See feedback/README.md.
feedback/*
!feedback/README.md
